Why "of course"?=A0 I realize that lojbanistan is dominated by English spea=
kers,=20
but it's not a language for English speakers.=A0 fui'vla should be based on=
=20
either words that are recognizable in many or most languages,=20
or on international nomneclature systems like the linnaean.=A0 In how=20
many languages does 'cool' mean 'cool'?

